==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~15 seconds<sup>150f~450f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 15~45 seconds<sup>450f~1,350f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Ranma Saotome (M) (Enemy)|Ranma Saotome (M)]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 15~45 seconds<sup>450f~1,350f</sup>.
**5 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

